// Package migrator collects the small, shared building blocks both
// migrator-identity and migrator-org binaries depend on. Per the
// Phase 1b design spec
// (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-02-phase-1b-migrators-design.md §3.4):
//
//   - Token       — caches the omnicore-migrator service-account
//                   access token; refreshes ~30s before expiry.
//   - Cursor      — NATS JetStream KV wrapper keyed by
//                   <binary>/<tenant>/<entity>; value is the legacy
//                   integer PK encoded as ASCII decimal.
//   - Rejection   — append-only JSON Lines writer for the per-run
//                   rejection report.
//   - Metrics     — six OTel instruments matching spec §13.
//
// The lib has no business logic; it factors out the boilerplate that
// would otherwise duplicate across the two binaries. Each component
// is testable without external infrastructure — Cursor uses a small
// KVBackend interface so tests pass an in-memory map; Token accepts
// any oauth2.TokenSource; Metrics accepts any metric.Meter; Rejection
// writes to a t.TempDir().
package migrator


